#: ../../source/to-regex-range_README.md:56
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"regex for matching `0001` through `5555` => "
"`/(0{3}[1-9]|0{2}[1-9][0-9]|0[1-9][0-9]{2}|[1-4][0-9]{3}|5[0-4][0-9]{2}|55[0-4][0-9]|555[0-5])/`"
